<title>MOROCCO: Malian prime minister arrives at Rabat.</title>
<headline>Malian prime minister arrives at Rabat.</headline>
<dateline>RABAT 1997-01-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Malian Prime Minister Ibrahim Keita on Monday arrived in Rabat on an official visit to boost cooperation, the official Moroccan news agency MAP said.</p>
<p>Keita is expected to hold talks with several Moroccan officials on cooperation between the two African countries.</p>
